  "description": "Questions with known right answers for Ask Rostr, scored on every run. 'must_include' = facts the answer has to contain; 'must_not_include' = things that would be wrong or unsafe (made-up people, pay figures). 'group', 'expected' and 'tags' are for people reading the dataset (shown on the Test results page); the tests use must_include / must_not_include.",
